e required filesystem permission so we can distinguish a real dependency issue from the sandbox restriction.\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[94] tool exec call: const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk just audit\",\"workdir\":\"/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":5000,\"tty\":true,\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Allow the repository's dependency audit to update/lock the Cargo advisory database outside the workspace so I can complete the clean baseline verification?\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"rtk\",\"just\",\"audit\"]}); text(JSON.stringify(r))\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[95] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 8.4 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\"chunk_id\":\"9eba52\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.000910292,\"session_id\":19695,\"original_token_count\":370,\"output\":\"\\u001b[1mmoon run :audit\\u001b[0m\\r\\n[ WARN 2026-09-16 10:29:36.536] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-conventional/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.536] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-manifests/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.536] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-model/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.536] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-graph/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.537] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-fixtures/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.537] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-changelog/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.537] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-moon/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.538] moon_task