 = await tools.write_stdin({session_id:56660,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:10000}); text(JSON.stringify(r))\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[79] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 30.0 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\"chunk_id\":\"94ea57\",\"wall_time_seconds\":30.003805875,\"session_id\":56660,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[80] tool send_message call: {\"target\":\"/root/correct_orchestration_plan\",\"message\":\"REDACTED\"}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[81] tool exec call: const r = await tools.write_stdin({session_id:56660,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:10000}); text(JSON.stringify(r))\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[82] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 9.8 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\"chunk_id\":\"f856bf\",\"wall_time_seconds\":9.729818709,\"exit_code\":1,\"original_token_count\":1557,\"output\":\"\\u001b[1mcargo test --doc --all-features\\u001b[0m\\r\\n    Finished `test` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.91s\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_changelog\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_cli\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_conventional\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_fixtures\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_format\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_graph\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_manifests\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_model\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_moon\\r\\n   Doc-tests callisto_vcs\\r\\n\\u001b[1mmoon run :audit\\u001b[0m\\r\\n[ WARN 2026-09-16 10:29:19.316] moon_actions::actions::install_dependencies  No internet connection, skipping dependency install  root=\\\"\\\" toolchain_id=\\\"rust\\\"\\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:19.352] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-model/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:19.352] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-vcs/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:19.352] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callis