it\\u001b[0m\\r\\n[ WARN 2026-09-16 10:29:36.536] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-conventional/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.536] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-manifests/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.536] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-model/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.536] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-graph/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.537] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-fixtures/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.537] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-changelog/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.537] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-moon/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.538] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-format/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.538] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-cli/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n[ WARN 10:29:36.538] moon_task_hasher::task_hasher  Attempted to hash input crates/callisto-vcs/Cargo.lock but it does not exist, skipping \\r\\n\"}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[86] tool exec call: const r = await tools.write_stdin({session_id:19695,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:5000}); text(JSON.stringify(r))\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[87] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 3.6 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\"chunk_id\":\"a0ffa4\",\"wall_time_seconds\":3.516022584,\"exit_code\":1,\"original_token_count\":11968,\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 11968)\\nTotal