tecture test that inventories all membership reader call sites and forbids an unhandled or optional error result.\\\",\\n-        \\\"Run `just ci`; expect formatting, lint, unit, integration, release-boundary, and sibling-gap tests to pass.\\\"\\n-      ],\\n-      \\\"commit_message\\\": \\\"test(graph): enforce workspace authority at release boundaries\\\",\\n-      \\\"depends_on\\\": [\\\"M-002\\\"],\\n-      \\\"covers_criteria\\\": [\\\"AC-003\\\", \\\"AC-005\\\", \\\"AC-006\\\", \\\"AC-007\\\"]\\n+      \\\"covers_criteria\\\": [\\\"AC-002\\\", \\\"AC-003\\\", \\\"AC-004\\\", \\\"AC-005\\\", \\\"AC-006\\\", \\\"AC-007\\\"]\\n@@\\n-    {\\\"batch_id\\\": \\\"M-B1\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Typed Cargo and uv authority\\\", \\\"target_crate\\\": \\\"callisto-graph\\\", \\\"task_ids\\\": [\\\"M-001\\\"]},\\n-    {\\\"batch_id\\\": \\\"M-B2\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Strict npm and pnpm authority\\\", \\\"target_crate\\\": \\\"callisto-graph\\\", \\\"task_ids\\\": [\\\"M-002\\\"]},\\n-    {\\\"batch_id\\\": \\\"M-B3\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Authority consumer migration\\\", \\\"target_crate\\\": \\\"callisto-graph and callisto-cli\\\", \\\"task_ids\\\": [\\\"M-003\\\"]}\\n+    {\\\"batch_id\\\": \\\"M-B1\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Atomic typed authority cutover\\\", \\\"target_crate\\\": \\\"callisto-graph\\\", \\\"task_ids\\\": [\\\"M-001\\\"]},\\n+    {\\\"batch_id\\\": \\\"M-B2\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Release-boundary propagation and final gate\\\", \\\"target_crate\\\": \\\"callisto-graph and callisto-cli\\\", \\\"task_ids\\\": [\\\"M-002\\\"]}\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\u003e\u003e\u003e TRANSCRIPT END\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Reviewed Codex session id: 01a0aa80-3aab-7313-9603-edf7533a1570\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\nSome conversation entries were omitted.\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"The Codex agent has requested the following action:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\u003e\u003e\u