even where model release.rs is shared. AC-006 publication of verified bytes is completed by convergence T3-DISPATCH; AC-008's full observer/dispatch gate runs only in PM-006 after convergence T6. AC-005 verifier implementation is PM-007 and complete artifact production is PM-008; orchestration invokes those owned interfaces rather than recreating them.\\\"\\n*** Update File: /private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/docs/projects/SPEC-RELEASE-CONVERGENCE-002.json\\n@@\\n       \\\"depends_on\\\": [\\n-        \\\"T3\\\"\\n+        \\\"T3\\\",\\n+        \\\"SPEC-RELEASE-BASELINE-READINESS-006:BR-002\\\"\\n       ],\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[65] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 4.8 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[66] tool exec call: const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk jq -r '.tasks[]|.id+\\\" \u003c- \\\"+((.depends_on//[])|join(\\\",\\\"))' docs/projects/SPEC-RELEASE-CONVERGENCE-002.json \u0026\u0026 rtk jq -r '.tasks[]|.id+\\\" \u003c- \\\"+((.depends_on//[])|join(\\\",\\\"))' docs/projects/SPEC-RELEASE-PRODUCT-MODEL-001.json\",\"workdir\":\"/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":8000}); text(r.output)\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[67] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n\nT1 \u003c- SPEC-RELEASE-PRODUCT-MODEL-001:PM-002\nT2 \u003c- \nT3 \u003c- T1,T2,SPEC-RELEASE-PRODUCT-MODEL-001:PM-005\nT3-DISPATCH \u003c- T3,SPEC-RELEASE-BASELINE-READINESS-006:BR-002\nT4 \u003c- T3-DISPATCH\nT5 \u003c- T4\nT5-FAILPOINT \u003c- T5,SPEC-RELEASE-PRODUCT-MODEL-001:PM-004\nT6 \u003c- T4,T5,T5-FAILPOINT\nPM-001 \u003c- \nPM-002 \u003c- PM-001\nPM-003 \u003c- SPEC-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP-AUTHORITY-004:M-002\nPM-004 \u003c- PM-001,PM-002,PM-003,SPEC-RELEASE-CONVERGENCE-002:T1,SPEC-RELEASE-CONVERGENCE-002:T2\nPM-005 \u003c- PM-002,PM-004\nPM-006 \u003c- PM-003,PM-004,PM-005,PM-007,PM-008,