esult: Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"workspace-manifest@1\",\n  \"title\": \"Workspace Manifest\",\n  \"description\": \"Verified workspace state and available verification capabilities discovered before implementation or audit work begins.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"workspace_root\", \"workspace_state\", \"languages\", \"language_files\", \"entry_points\", \"live_files\", \"capabilities\", \"baseline\", \"confidence\", \"reasoning\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"workspace_root\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n    \"workspace_state\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"revision\", \"dirty\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"revision\": {\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"], \"description\": \"Current commit or equivalent immutable state identifier when available.\"},\n        \"dirty\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"},\n        \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n      }\n    },\n    \"languages\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"uniqueItems\": true,\n      \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n      \"description\": \"Every language affected by the requested scope; values are open for future ecosystems.\"\n    },\n    \"language_files\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"language\", \"files\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"language\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n          \"files\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1, \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}}\n        }\n      },\n      \"description\": \"Maps each affected language to its scoped live files for polyglot consumers.\"\n    },\n    \"entry_points\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}},\n    \"live_files\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}},\n    \"dead_files\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}},\n    \"capabilities\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"kind\", \"available\", \"source\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"kind\": {\"enum\": [\"build\", \"test\", \"type_check\", \"lint\", \"mutation\", \"property\", \"fuzz\", \"race\", \"integration\", \"boundary\"]},\n          \"available\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"},\n          \"tool\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n          \"command\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n          \"source\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"description\": \"Workspace file or observed command that established availability.\"}\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"baseline\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"status\", \"evidence\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"status\": {\"enum\": [\"pass\", \"fail\", \"not_run\"]},\n        \"command\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n        \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n      }\n    },\n    \"confidence\": {\"enum\": [\"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"]},\n    \"spec_file_path\": {\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]},\n    \"plan_file_path\": {\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]},\n    \"spec_drift_warning\": {\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]},\n    \"plan_drift_warning\": {\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]},\n    \"workflow_provenance\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"plugin\", \"version\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"plugin\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n          \"version\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n          \"source_revision\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"reasoning\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Private producer scratchpad; not forwarded downstream.\"}\n  }\n}\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[73] tool wait_agent call: {\"timeout_ms\":10000}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[74] tool wait_agent result: {\"message\":\"Wait timed out.\",\"timed_out\":true}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[75] tool exec call: const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk jq empty docs/projects/*.json docs/specs/*.json \u0026\u0026 rtk jq -r '[.linked_spec,.spec_hash,(.tasks|length),([.tasks[].covers_criteria[]]|unique|length)]|@tsv' docs/projects/*.json \u0026\u0026 rtk shasum -a 256 docs/specs/*.json\",\"workdir\":\"/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":10000}); text(r.output)\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[76] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n\n\nSPEC-RELEASE-BASELINE-READINESS-006\tsha256:03e216b16c818a04f0f50c49c1128045c7482a47133d3c3e6206749971949aa2\t2\t5\nSPEC-RELEASE-CONVERGENCE-002\tsha256:ed5c36eabbd88760016b75a72e2c8c8184ecc0d9af9adf307c639f8fce7b656e\t8\t13\nSPEC-RELEASE-ORCHESTRATION-003\tsha256:111cf1ca8a6a8820ee21289ddaa5b7a7a91da290adf5195ac1a3fe6b9b1e98ab\t8\t14\nSPEC-RELEASE-PRODUCT-MODEL-001\tsha256:4f67ea3fb3d87703133e7845d0cdfc9f3ff6def8f2f0e05c3dc23fe4108becb6\t8\t11\nSPEC-SETUP-IMMUTABLE-VERSION-005\tsha256:d103f22f79d212f22d5924599cea64f4a8b67d8a845c26e4d654d9764c6765f4\t4\t7\nSPEC-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP-AUTHORITY-004\tsha256:231673ff3cf4c82183670dfd878b04e5e67bd3d89e4aa5e420bcbbd048d10854\t2\t7\n03e216b16c818a04f0f50c49c1128045c7482a47133d3c3e6206749971949aa2  docs/specs/SPEC-RELEASE-BASELINE-READINESS-006.json\ned5c36eabbd88760016b75a72e2c8c8184ecc0d9af9adf307c639f8fce7b656e  docs/specs/SPEC-RELEASE-CONVERGENCE-002.json\n111cf1ca8a6a8820e