",\n+ \"getrandom 0.3.4\",\n  \"once_cell\",\n  \"rustix 1.1.4\",\n  \"windows-sys 0.61.2\",\n  +11 -11\n Downloading crates ...\nwarning: spurious network error (3 tries remaining): [6] Couldn't resolve host name (Could not resolve host: static.crates.io)\nwarning: spurious network error (2 tries remaining): [6] Couldn't resolve host name (Could not resolve host: static.crates.io)\nwarning: spurious network error (1 try remaining): [6] Couldn't resolve host name (Could not resolve host: static.crates.io)\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[97] tool exec call: const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk cargo tree -i rustls@0.23.45\",\"workdir\":\"/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery\",\"yield_time_ms\":30000,\"max_output_tokens\":10000,\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Allow Cargo to download the newly selected fixed dependency versions so I can verify their reverse dependency paths?\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"rtk\",\"cargo\",\"tree\"]}); text(JSON.stringify(r))\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\u003e\u003e\u003e TRANSCRIPT END\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Reviewed Codex session id: 01a0aa80-3aab-7313-9603-edf7533a1570\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\nSome conversation entries were omitted.\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"The Codex agent has requested the following action:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\u003e\u003e\u003e APPROVAL REQUEST START\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Assess the exact planned action below. Use read-only tool checks when local state matters.\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Planned action JSON:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\n  \"command\": [\n    \"/bin/zsh\",\n    \"-lc\",\n    \"rtk cargo tree -i rustls@0.23.45\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \"/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery\",\n  \"justification\": \"Allow Cargo to download the newly selected fixed dependency versions so I can verify their reverse dependency paths?\",\n  \"sandbox_permissions\": \"require_escalated\",\n  \"tool\": \"exec_comman