parent.join(\"child\");\n+            std::fs::create_dir_all(\u0026child).unwrap();\n+            std::fs::write(child.join(authority_file), malformed).unwrap();\n \n-    if dir.join(\".moon\").is_dir() {\n-        return true;\n+            match find_workspace_root(\u0026child) {\n+                Err(LocateError::MembershipParse {\n+                    ecosystem: reported, ..\n+                }) =\u003e assert_eq!(reported, ecosystem, \"{ecosystem} must stop root selection at child\"),\n+                other =\u003e panic!(\"{ecosystem} malformed child must not select parent, got {other:?}\"),\n+            }\n+        }\n     }\n-\n-    false\n }\n  +38 -28\n[full diff: rtk git diff --no-compact]\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[60] tool wait_agent call: {\"timeout_ms\":60000}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[61] tool wait_agent result: {\"message\":\"Wait completed.\",\"timed_out\":false}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[62] tool wait_agent call: {\"timeout_ms\":60000}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[63] tool wait_agent result: {\"message\":\"Wait completed.\",\"timed_out\":false}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[64] assistant: Agent message from /root/implement_membership_m2:\nMessage Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/implement_membership_m2\nPayload:\nM-002 expanded and complete.\n\nProduction fixes:\n- Typed membership readers now govern root discovery; malformed nested authority cannot fall through to a parent workspace.\n- CLI resolves root authority before Git probing.\n- `release execute` revalidates membership/intent before artifact verification or provider-capable commands.\n\nTests:\n- Nested Cargo/uv/npm/pnpm malformed-authority CLI planning cases.\n- Execute boundary with fake publishers and credential environment, asserting no effects/state.\n- Root and sibling-gap coverage.\n\nVerification:\n- `moon run callisto-cli:test` passed.\n- `just fmt-check` and `git diff --check` passed.\n- Graph unit tests passed; broad graph suite has one unrelated concurrent VCS argv expectation failure in `tags_tests.rs`.\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[65] tool followup_task call: {\"target\":\"/root/review_membership_m2\",\"message\":\"REDACTED\"}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[66] tool wait_agent call: {\"timeout_ms\":60000}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[67] tool wait_agent result: {\"message\":\"Wait completed.\",\"timed_out\":false}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[68] assistant: Agent message from /root/implement_product_b1:\nMessage Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/implement_product_b1\nPayload:\nStrengthened private T1 evidence validation in `release.rs`.\n\n- Receipt construction now requires intent-bound `ObservationExpectations` derived from a validated successor artifact manifest.\n- Registry and asset evidence must match the exact expected slot digest and byte length.\n- Remote-tag evidence must match the expected tag annotation digest and source commit.\n- Forge publish evidence must match the complete expected product-asset roster digest.\n- Forge prepare and forge publish now use distinct evidence variants; cross-role reuse is rejected.\n- Every evidence variant has `schemaVersion: 1`; unsupported versions and nested unknown fields are rejected by strict serde schemas.\n- Updated the complete observation receipt test to build manifest-bound expectations and validate exact generated evidence.\n\nVerification:\n\n- `rtk cargo test -p callisto-model successor --lib` — 5 passed.\n- `rtk just fmt-check` — passed.\n- `rtk just lint` — passed.\n- `rtk git diff --check -- crates/callisto-model/src/release.rs` — passed.\n\nThe remaining requested field-isolated negative matrix can be expanded further, but the production-model checks now reject any mismatched registry/asset digest or length, tag annotation digest, forge asset-roster digest, cross-role proof, unsupported evidence version, and nested unknown evidence fields.\n","type":"input_text"},{