s\\n        PASS [   2.009s] (1372/1387) callisto-vcs::revwalk_bound_count_test commits_since_with_pathspec_bounds_walk_to_since_head_range\\n        PASS [   5.484s] (1373/1387) callisto-graph::graph_tests real_release_units::real_callisto_train_keeps_fixture_source_bump_outside_durable_authority\\n        PASS [   5.875s] (1374/1387) callisto-graph::graph_tests real_release_units::dev_only_dependency_consumers_do_not_relay_release_bumps\\n        PASS [  15.374s] (1375/1387) callisto-moon::moon_wasm_sandbox define_extension_config_matches_moon_wire_protocol\\n\"}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[67] tool exec call: const r = await tools.write_stdin({session_id:79279,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:8000}); text(JSON.stringify(r));\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[68] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 30.0 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\"chunk_id\":\"d63c60\",\"wall_time_seconds\":30.00077675,\"session_id\":79279,\"original_token_count\":70,\"output\":\"        PASS [  13.988s] (1376/1387) callisto-moon::moon_wasm_sandbox execute_extension_git_binary_absent_reports_notfound_via_real_exec_seam\\n        PASS [  14.446s] (1377/1387) callisto-moon::moon_wasm_sandbox execute_extension_malformed_moon_project_graph_json_fails_cleanly\\n\"}\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[69] assistant: Agent message from /root/review_product_pm3_final:\nMessage Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_product_pm3_final\nPayload:\nPASS — the prior blocker is resolved. No new blocking findings.\n\n- `cascade.rs:282` requires both dependency and dependent to be releasable before propagating a version bump. Dependency-spec maintenance remains at `:240`; fixed/linked source-version coordination remains at `:303` and `:381`.\n- `commands/version.rs:107` excludes dev-only prerelease-exit seeds. Both production cascade constructors use the shared classification resolver: `version.rs:119` and `snapshot.rs:53`. All test constructors were migrated.\n- `commands/release_decision.rs:344` accepts coordinated dev-only source bumps for fixed and linked groups, checking the claimed target and increasing version. Ungrouped dev-only packages now receive dependency-spec updates without the unclaimed version bump that caused the original failure.\n- Dependency-spec-only edits to an otherwise unselected releasable consumer do not grant release authority. Committed verification permits unchanged versions (`release_decision.rs:341`); independently selected consumers remain fingerprinted over their manifest bytes (`release.rs:1143`).\n- Existing exclusion guards still reject dev-only decision entries and causal references, including during fresh intent derivation.\n\nIndependent verification: `rtk moon run callisto-graph:test -- --test graph_tests` passed **5/5 tests**, including the 12-case cascade regression matrix and real Callisto committed-decision tests.\n\nProduct-operation migration and compatibility-preview presentation remain explicit later-plan work. No files edited.\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[70] assistant: The independent re-review now passes. It confirmed the corrected invariant in both production cascade constructors and the committed-verification path, including fixed, linked, and ungrouped cases; the new 12-case regression matrix passed independently. The final full workspace rerun is still progressing without failures.\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[71] tool exec call: const r = await tools.write_stdin({session_id:79279,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:8000}); text(JSON.stringify(r));\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[72] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 30.0 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\"chunk_id\":\"771fbe\",\"wall_time_seconds\":30.001946,\"session_id\":79279,\"original_token_count\":100,\"output\":\"        PASS [  13.876s] (1378/1387) callisto-moon::moon_wasm_sandbox execute_extension_moon_binary_absent_from_path_fails_cleanly\\n        PASS [  13.852s] (1379/1387) c