g callisto-conventional v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-conventional)\n    Checking gix-index v0.55.0\n    Checking gix-worktree-stream v0.36.1\n Documenting callisto-changelog v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-changelog)\n Documenting callisto-fixtures v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-fixtures)\n Documenting callisto-format v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-format)\n    Checking idna_adapter v1.2.2\n Documenting callisto-conventional v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-conventional)\n Documenting callisto-manifests v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-manifests)\n    Checking gix-submodule v0.34.0\n    Checking gix-archive v0.36.1\n    Checking idna v1.1.0\n    Checking gix-worktree v0.56.0\n    Checking url v2.5.8\n    Checking gix-diff v0.67.1\n    Checking gix-dir v0.29.1\n    Checking gix-worktree-state v0.34.1\n    Checking gix-merge v0.20.1\n    Checking gix-blame v0.17.1\n    Checking gix-status v0.34.1\n    Checking gix v0.87.1\n    Checking callisto-vcs v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-vcs)\n Documenting callisto-vcs v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-vcs)\n    Checking callisto-graph v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-graph)\n Documenting callisto-graph v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-release-recovery/crates/callisto-graph)\nerror: unresolved link to `PublishOrchestrator::execute`\n   --\u003e crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/publish.rs:691:55\n    |\n691 | /// `PackageId::Prefixed { ecosystem, name }` shape [`PublishOrchestrator::execute`]\n    |                                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ no item named `PublishOrchestrator` in scope\n    |\n    = note: `-D rustdoc::broken-intra-doc-links` implied by `-D warnings`\n    = help: to override `-D warnings` add `#[all