pendency tree (`warpgate` -\u003e `reqwest` -\u003e `hyper-rustls`) pinned `rustls 0.23.43`, affected by [RUSTSEC-2026-0285](https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0285): TLS 1.3 handshake messages sent at the wrong encryption level could be incorrectly accepted. Bumped to `0.23.45`, the version the advisory names as fixed.\\n+`callisto-moon`'s dependency tree pinned `rustls 0.23.43`, affected by [RUSTSEC-2026-0285](https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0285), and the yanked `chacha20 0.10.1`. Update both transitive dependencies to audited releases without moving unrelated packages.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[94] tool exec result: Script failed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n\nScript error:\napply_patch verification failed: Failed to find expected lines in /private/tmp/callisto-pr97/Cargo.lock:\n[[package]]\nname = \"chacha20\"\nversion = \"0.10.1\"\nsource = \"registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index\"\nchecksum = \"a834ab695783fb6f532129252a2880dc16ac960f58a4445af443e812df9fea98\"\ndependencies = [\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[95] tool exec call: const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk rg -n -A10 -B2 '^name = \\\"chacha20\\\"' Cargo.lock \u0026\u0026 rtk rg -n -A12 -B2 '^name = \\\"tempfile\\\"' Cargo.lock \u0026\u0026 rtk bat --paging=never .changeset/bump-rustls-tls-advisory.md\",\"workdir\":\"/private/tmp/callisto-pr97\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":12000}); text(r.output);\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[96] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n\n741-\n742-[[package]]\n743:name = \"chacha20\"\n744-version = \"0.10.1\"\n745-source = \"registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index\"\n746-checksum = \"d524456ba66e72eb8b115ff89e01e497f8e6d11d78b70b1aa13c0fbd97540a81\"\n747-dependencies = [\n748- \"cfg-if\",\n749- \"cpufeatures 0.3.0\",\n750- \"rand_core 0.10.1\",\n751-]\n752-\n753-[[package]]\n6852-\n