n    Checking moon_common v2.0.7\n    Checking moon_target v3.0.0\n    Checking warpgate_api v0.17.6\n    Checking moon_config v2.1.0\n    Checking proto_pdk_api v0.31.13\n    Checking warpgate_pdk v0.16.5\n    Checking toml v0.8.23\n    Checking callisto-vcs v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-pr97/crates/callisto-vcs)\n    Checking callisto-format v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-pr97/crates/callisto-format)\n    Checking callisto-changelog v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-pr97/crates/callisto-changelog)\n    Checking callisto-manifests v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-pr97/crates/callisto-manifests)\n    Checking callisto-graph v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-pr97/crates/callisto-graph)\n    Checking moon_file_group v2.0.4\n    Checking moon_task v2.1.0\n    Checking moon_project v2.0.6\n    Checking moon_pdk_api v2.0.4\n    Checking moon_pdk v2.0.4\n    Checking callisto-moon v0.7.2 (/private/tmp/callisto-pr97/crates/callisto-moon)\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 13.24s\ncargo rustc -p callisto-moon --lib --target wasm32-wasip1 --features pdk --crate-type cdylib\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.22s\n\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[66] tool exec call: const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk just lint\",\"workdir\":\"/private/tmp/callisto-pr97\",\"yield_time_ms\":30000,\"max_output_tokens\":12000}); text(r.output);\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[67] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 0.8 seconds\nOutput:\n\ncargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.56s\n\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[68] tool exec call: const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk git status --short \u0026\u0026 rtk git diff -- .changeset/bump-rustls-tls-advisory.md Cargo.lock \u0026\u0026 rtk git log -5 --pretty=format:'%h %s'\",\"workdir\":\"/private/tmp/callisto-pr97\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":20000}); text(r.output);\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[69] tool exec result: Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n\n M .changeset/bump-rustls-tls-advisory.md\n M Cargo.lock.changeset/bump-rustls-tls-advisory.md | 4 ++--\n Cargo.lock                             | 4 ++--\n 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)\n\nChanges:\n\n.changeset/bump-rustls-tls-advisory.md\n@@ -2,6 +2,6 @@\n callisto-moon: patch\n ---\n \n-**Bump rustls to drop a TLS handshake vulnerability (RUSTSEC-2026-0285)**\n+**Restore the dependency audit baseline**\n \n-`callisto-moon`'s dependency tree (`warpgate` -\u003e `reqwest` -\u003e `hyper-rustls`) pinned `rustls 0.23.43`, affected by [RUSTSEC-2026-0285](https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0285): TLS 1.3 handshake messages sent at the wrong encryption level could be incorrectly accepted. Bumped to `0.23.45`, the version the advisory names as fixed.\n+`callisto-moon`'s dependency tree pinned `rustls 0.23.43`, affected by [RUSTSEC-2026-0285](https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0285), and the yanked `chacha20 0.10.1`. Update both transitive dependencies to audited releases without moving unrelated packages.\n  +2 -2\n\nCargo.lock\n@@ -741,9 +741,9 @@ checksum = \"f079e83a288787bcd14a6aea84cee5c87a67c5a3e660c30f557a3d24761b3527\"\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"chacha20\"\n-version = \"0.10.1\"\n+version = \"0.10.2\"\n source = \"registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index\"\n-checksum = \"d524456ba66e72eb8b115ff89e01e497f8e6d11d78b70b1aa13c0fbd97540a81\"\n+checksum = \"65c35e4b699c7e15ccbe7ee35c005e4fc0a278d22238a2857e6ce2dadeda1b06\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"cfg-if\",\n  \"cpufeatures 0.3.0\",\n  +2 -2\ne2fc0404 fix(moon): bump rustls to drop a TLS handshake vulnerability (RUSTSEC-2026-0285)\n0ffe567f fix(ci): download execute's handoff artifacts outside the workspace (#94)\n0e0016ed chore(release): version packages (#93)\n9d25a5af test(ci,graph): close the last two regression-coverage gaps from the release-