 a patch changeset for `callisto-moon`.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n- `MOON_FORCE=true just audit` — all 10 crates passed\\n- `just test` — all 1,381 workspace tests and doctests passed\\n- `just fmt-check`\\n- `just lint`\\n- `just wasm-check`\\n- Verified the resulting `rustls` and `chacha20` dependency paths\",\"headRefName\":\"fix/rustls-tls-advisory\",\"headRefOid\":\"e2fc0404897b9333cb9ee5c776f3f164bdc6aeb0\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:39Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/runs/35109210858/job/104838220507\",\"name\":\"Workflow Contracts\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:23Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Callisto CI \u0026 Validation\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:59Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/runs/35109210858/job/104838220923\",\"name\":\"Code Formatting (Moon \u0026 Just)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:24Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Callisto CI \u0026 Validation\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:33:47Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/runs/35109210858/job/104838220977\",\"name\":\"Clippy Lints (Moon \u0026 Just)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:24Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Callisto CI \u0026 Validation\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:38:50Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/runs/35109210858/job/104838220897\",\"name\":\"Test Suite \u0026 WASM Check (ubuntu-latest)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:24Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Callisto CI \u0026 Validation\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:41:58Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/runs/35109210858/job/104838220943\",\"name\":\"Test Suite \u0026 WASM Check (macos-latest)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:31Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Callisto CI \u0026 Validation\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:38:30Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/runs/35109210858/job/104838220820\",\"name\":\"Code Coverage \u0026 Test Report\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:24Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Callisto CI \u0026 Validation\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:33:13Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/runs/35109210858/job/104838220941\",\"name\":\"Security \u0026 Advisory Audit (Moon \u0026 Just)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:32:24Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Callisto CI \u0026 Validation\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:43:34Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/runs/35109210858/job/104841972324\",\"name\":\"Validate Changesets \u0026 Workspace Status\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-16T14:42:00Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Callisto CI \u0026 Validation\"}],\"title\":\"fix(moon): restore the dependency audit baseline\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/97\"}\n\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[86] assistant: GitHub accepted the PR text edit, but the remote head still points to the old commit despite the push command returning without an error. I’m treating that as a failed push and checking the branch relationship before retrying; I won’t report completion until the remote SHA is the amended commit.\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n[87] tool exec call: const r = await tools.exec_command({\"cmd\":\"rtk git status --short --branch \u0026\u0026 rtk git rev-parse HEAD \u0026\u0026 r